<!-- =====================================================
     PHASE 8 BANNER
     ===================================================== -->
<div class="p8-banner">
    <div class="p8-phase-pill">Phase 8 · Grid-Solar Hybrid Steam Electric</div>
    <h1>Steam-Rail <em>Solar-Grid Charged</em> Hybrid Drive</h1>
    <p>
        Phase 8 introduces a 40kWh plug-in EV battery as the primary energy source, charged from
        the grid or an integrated solar array. The roof-mounted solar panel array provides continuous
        top-up while parked or driving. Six spinning alternators remain — feeding recovered energy
        back to Battery A. Battery B stays as the dedicated backup and EV motor supply.
        No fossil fuels. No combustion. Sunlight and grid electricity in, torque out.
    </p>
</div>

